Unchanged upstream: Cargo.toml, README.md, Changelog.md, LICENSE-MIT.md,
examples, benches, and all src files except the delta below.

Owned delta: src/roo (raw records and XML compatibility checks),
src/xlsx/cells_reader/compat.rs (roo row selection and batching),
src/xlsx/cells_reader.rs (shared stock/raw cell stream),
src/xlsx/mod.rs (shared inline-string decoding),
src/lib.rs (public module), src/utils.rs (public entity helper).

Generate the patch against the exact upstream checkout with:
  ruby script/calamine_patch.rb /path/to/calamine > /tmp/roo.patch

The source gem carries the fork; builds do not fetch a mutable Git branch.
See docs/calamine-shared-reader.md for validation and the adoption decision.
